      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekusukuma isazumlayo simlinga sisithi: Mfundisi, ngizakwenzani ukuze ngidle ilifa lokuphila okungapheliyo na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.35+MAT.22.36+MAT.22.37+MAT.22.38+MAT.22.39+MAT.22.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:35–40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.28+MRK.12.29+MRK.12.30+MRK.12.31+MRK.12.32+MRK.12.33+MRK.12.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mark 12:28–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuso: Kulotshweni emlayweni, uwufunda kanjani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saphendula sathi: Wothanda iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho ngenhliziyo yakho yonke, langomphefumulo wakho wonke, langamandla akho wonke, langengqondo yakho yonke, lomakhelwane wakho njengalokhu uzithanda wena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 19:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 6:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuso: Uphendule kuhle; yenza lokhu, uzakuphila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 18:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa yena ethanda ukuzilungisa wathi kuJesu: Umakhelwane wami ungubani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu waphendula wathi: Umuntu othile wehla evela eJerusalema esiya eJeriko; watheleka phakathi kwabaphangi abamhlubula impahla, bamtshaya, basuka bahamba bamtshiya ephos’ ukufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpristi othile waqabuka esehla ngaleyondlela; wathi embona wanqwetha, wadlula eceleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaba njalo lomLevi, efika kuleyondawo embona wanqwetha, wadlula eceleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa umSamariya othile owayesendleleni wafika kuye; kwathi embona wamhawukela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waya kuye, wabopha amanxeba akhe ewathela amagcobo lewayini, wamkhwelisa enyamazaneni yakhe, wamusa endlini yezihambi, wamlondoloza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakusasa wakhupha inhlamvu ezimbili zemali, wazinika umninindlu, esithi: Umlondoloze, uba uchitha okudlula lokhu, ngizakubuyisela kuwe ekubuyeni kwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kambe nguwuphi ngokubona kwakho kulaba abathathu owaba ngumakhelwane wakhe owatheleka phakathi kwabaphangi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: Ngulowo owamenzela isihawu. Wasesithi kuye uJesu: Hamba wenze njalo lawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ekuhambeni kwakhe wangena emzini othile; owesifazana othiwa nguMatha, wamamukela endlini yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joha 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayelodadewabo othiwa nguMariya, owahlala ngasenyaweni zeNkosi, walizwa ilizwi layo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uMatha wakhathazeka ngokusebenza okunengi. Weza kuye wathi: Nkosi, kawukhathaleli ukuthi udadewethu ungitshiyile ukusebenza ngedwa na? Ake umtshele ukuba angisize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa iNkosi yamphendula yathi: Matha, Matha, uyaphisekela izinto, ukhathazeke ngokunengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa yinye into edingekayo; uMariya ukhethile isabelo esihle angayikwamukwa sona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
